const reasons=[
  ['01','You’ll find more than you expect','Most fungi fruit briefly and only when conditions line up. One visit sees a sliver of what lives in a place; repeat visits, across seasons and years, fill the picture in.'],
  ['02','The place starts to answer questions','Which species come back to the same log? What fruits after a wet July, and what doesn’t? An inventory turns a list of finds into patterns you can actually compare.'],
  ['03','Your records become shared data','Observations with dates, photos and habitat notes on iNaturalist can be used by researchers, park staff and other naturalists, long after the walk is over.'],
